     1,
     "You can use conditionalPanel for this: <a href=\"http://rstudio.github.com/shiny/tutorial/#dynamic-ui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstudio.github.com/shiny/tutorial/%23dynamic-ui&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792410862744000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ujaSvU3RzjOQbbNyUpKKM\">http://rstudio.github.com/shiny/tutorial/#dynamic-ui</a><div><br></div><div>Example code for this scenario here: <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/a/13315995/139922\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/a/13315995/139922&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792410862744000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1XOPkLlXsz_wYG6Yw4uuuI\">http://stackoverflow.com/a/13315995/139922</a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
